{'symbol': 'KO', 'date': '2022-11-30 08:00:00', 'title': 'THE COCA-COLA COMPANY NAMES HENRIQUE BRAUN TO NEWLY CREATED ROLE OF PRESIDENT, INTERNATIONAL DEVELOPMENT', 'text': 'ATLANTA--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE COCA-COLA COMPANY TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT HENRIQUE BRAUN HAS BEEN NAMED TO A NEWLY CREATED ROLE OF PRESIDENT, INTERNATIONAL DEVELOPMENT. IN THIS POSITION, BRAUN WILL OVERSEE SEVEN OPERATING UNITS THAT SPAN DOZENS OF COUNTRIES AND TERRITORIES AROUND THE WORLD.'}